      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note: To get the media, replace the\u00A0media-typed URN sub-string urn:li:media: to https://media.licdn.com/mpr/mpr . For example, if the field value is urn:li:media:/gcrc/dms/image/ABC/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0?e=1525021200\u0026v=alpha\u0026t=abc123 , you can modify it to https://media.licdn.com/mpr/mpr/gcrc/dms/image/ABC/background-profile-shrink_800_800/0?e=1525021200\u0026v=alpha\u0026t=abc123 to retrieve it as a media URL via the LinkedIn CDN.",
